"NSMotionUsageDescription" = "NATURaL uses AirPods motion to keep spatial audio aligned with your head during chair yoga. Motion stays on this device.";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "NATURaL uses the camera for an optional on-device AR pose coach. Video is processed on this device and is never uploaded.";
"NSAppleMusicUsageDescription" = "NATURaL plays adaptive music during your chair yoga sessions, adjusting tempo and energy based on your biofeedback.";
"NSHealthShareUsageDescription" = "NATURaL reads heart rate, HRV, sleep, and activity data to compute your Shannon Collapse Index and adapt your session in real time. With your explicit consent, NATURaL may also read medication clinical records you connected in the Health app to help you manage user-entered prescriptions — never without your opt-in, and never as medical advice.";
