"NSHealthClinicalHealthRecordsShareUsageDescription" = "With your explicit opt-in, NATURaL imports medication records from institutions you connected in the Health app so you can manage reminders and CareKit tasks. This is user-managed data, not medical advice. Confirm all prescriptions with your clinician. NATURaL does not log into pharmacies or scrape pharmacy websites.";
